scn 1
# Passing within a small click (2026-11-16; tools/legion_overtake_test.py): knights at the rear of a block,
# 3 + 4 slow 2x2 bodies (speed 1.10, Aramon Swordsmen) in two rows ahead of 3 fast 3x3 ones (2.9, Aramon Knights),
# sent with ONE right-click to a point about 200 px from the click's centre: too short to pass. Asset-free, open field.
name overtake-click-rear-200
ticks 4000
players 1
weapons off
map flat 128 160
type slow mover 2 2500 1 1.10
type mid mover 2 2500 1 1.9
type fast mover 3 2500 1 2.9
group S1 0 slow 3 rect 56 70 72 74 pitch=5
group S2 0 slow 4 rect 54 76 74 80 pitch=5
group F1 0 fast 3 rect 56 82 72 86 pitch=6
at 5 move S1,S2,F1 64 65
